  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The International Programme Fund is designed to support programme activity aligning with the UK government&apos;s foreign policy in Angola. This includes, identifying, promoting, and delivering bilateral economic partnerships; working with partners to improve the situation in southern Angola, caused by food insecurity, drought, and climate change; promoting inclusive and sustainable development.</narrative>
  </description>
